                                                "sense_id": "63b231c8-65b7-312f-96e1-6506562b73b0",
                                                "text": "There are only eight levels but the varied game modes (including time attacks, survivals, team deathmatches, hunts, and sieges) in both single and multi-player keeps things interesting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f7a40e7-7ca4-4e38-bd87-86db738ef1f9",
                                                "sense_id": "63b231c8-65b7-312f-96e1-6506562b73b0",
                                                "text": "The player continued to describe their own experience with deathmatch, explaining sometimes it takes several minutes for the deathmatch to load — meaning by the time they spawn, the game is almost over."
                                            }
